    dct:created "2022-05-23" ;
    dct:creator "Guangdong Provincial Key Laboratory for Urbanization and Geo-simulation, Sun Yat-sen University" ;
    dct:description "The CLCD dataset consists of 600 pairs image of cropland change samples. Each group of samples is composed of two images and a corresponding binary label of cropland change. The main types of change annotated in CLCD include buildings, roads, lakes and bare soil lands, etc." ;
